{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_04_data_model_frozen_design", "label": "docs/04 is FROZEN DESIGN, not a build order (Law 9)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every table is the reference that keeps future modules coherent, but tables are AUTHORED only when their owning module's slice begins; designing ahead guarantees refactors once real slices meet reality."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_tenants", "label": "tenants table (multi-tenant root, RLS root key)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "tenants.id IS the Better Auth organization.id, created in the same transaction at signup \u2014 no mapping table, no drift."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_users", "label": "users table (domain profile, 1:1 with auth user)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_user_roles", "label": "user_roles table (six stackable presets)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Permission is OR across held roles and visibility is the widest scope held; no per-user permission override table exists, deliberately (D28)."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_customers", "label": "customers table (phone is identity, dedupe root)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries consent, DND, do-not-call and preferred_language so the ComplianceGate reads one row per dial; merged rows are tombstones, never deleted."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_leads", "label": "leads table (the funnel spine)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_lead_stage_machine", "label": "lead_stage state machine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Raw stage UPDATEs are forbidden \u2014 transitions run only through service-layer functions so reason-mandatory rules, reopen restore points and won\u2192project creation happen atomically."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_activities", "label": "activities table (polymorphic append-only timeline)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Polymorphic JSONB rather than one table per event type: the timeline is rendered as one stream and never joined per-kind; a Zod discriminated union keeps payloads typed."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_sites", "label": "sites table (the physical roof/building)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_surveys", "label": "surveys table (versioned-append)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A revisit inserts a new version row and nothing mutates \u2014 this is also the PowerSync conflict story, so offline captures never fight over one row."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_designs", "label": "designs table (JSONB payload + mirrored query columns)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The design graph stays JSONB because it is a deep single-editor document mutated hundreds of times per session; relational decomposition would buy nothing and cost the ported normalize/fingerprint machinery."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_engineer_signoffs", "label": "engineer_signoffs table (append-only structural honesty)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Structural adequacy is never computed \u2014 this table records who signed and when, and a design edit after approval drops signoff_status back to draft."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_design_blocks", "label": "design_blocks table (scale-program zones)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Blocks and tables are relational and outside the payload because at 100 MW they are the server-side query surface \u2014 shading jobs read blocks without hydrating a multi-MB payload."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_design_tables", "label": "design_tables table (mounting tables; panels derived, never persisted)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_proposals", "label": "proposals table (one object, two entry paths)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Staleness is derived, never stored: the latest version's pinned design_fp is compared against the live designs.design_fp."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_proposal_versions", "label": "proposal_versions table (immutable, append-only)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The snapshot is JSONB because it is a commercial document frozen at send time \u2014 read whole, rendered whole, and must never drift when catalogs move."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_proposal_components", "label": "proposal_components table (the mandatory gate)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Components are relational rather than inside the snapshot because the mandatory-gate validation and BOM reconciliation query them by category."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_tranches", "label": "tranches table (one money path, schedule \u2192 collection)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_customer_links", "label": "customer_links table (tokenised, no login ever)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "One URL advances in place through proposal \u2192 progress \u2192 handover; public reads go through SECURITY DEFINER functions scoped to the link's single deal, never a broad RLS policy, and links are never revoked over unpaid money."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_projects", "label": "projects table (light by design: status + documents + money)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_project_stage_machine", "label": "project_stage 9-stage state machine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_project_payments", "label": "project_payments table (append-only receipts ledger)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Append-only with reversal rows, never edited \u2014 this is the received side of the money path and feeds the locked money-invariant test."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_platform_catalog_items", "label": "platform_catalog_items table (curated master catalog)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_price_book_versions", "label": "price_book_versions table (versioned non-catalog rates)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Rates are JSONB per version \u2014 an immutable snapshot read whole by the BOM engine; price updates create a new version, never mutate in place, and sent proposals pin the version."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_agent_configs", "label": "agent_configs table (versioned-append)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Configs are never edited in place; publishing inserts version n+1 and queued calls keep the version they were queued with (D36)."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_call_queue", "label": "call_queue table (scheduled agent work)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_calls", "label": "calls table (every call ledgered, human and agent)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_tenant_phone_numbers", "label": "tenant_phone_numbers table (platform Exophone or BYO)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_routing_policies", "label": "routing_policies table (versioned-append call routing as tenant data)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_call_handoffs", "label": "call_handoffs table (append-only context-handoff ledger)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_subscriptions", "label": "subscriptions table", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_entitlements", "label": "entitlements table (current effective limits)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Relational rather than JSONB because it is queried on the hot path for the soft-block check; plan capacity ceilings stay in plans.bundles so the entitlement_key enum remains metered-quota-only."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_usage_events", "label": "usage_events table (append-only metered ledger)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Range-partitioned by month with a producer-supplied idempotency key so duplicate emits are no-ops; rollups are derived and safe to rebuild because the ledger is the truth."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_files", "label": "files table (Tigris object registry)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_tenant_integration_credentials", "label": "tenant_integration_credentials table (BYO secrets, envelope-encrypted)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_market_rules_packs", "label": "market_rules_packs table (platform, versioned market config)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Injected into the domain resolveRules(ctx) so the module-level global dies; publishing a new pack self-stales fingerprints and a new market is a new pack with zero schema change."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_webhook_events", "label": "webhook_events table (platform ingress dedupe)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unique (provider, external_event_id) turns at-least-once delivery into exactly-once processing: verify HMAC \u2192 insert (conflict = duplicate, skip) \u2192 fast 2xx \u2192 BullMQ processes."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_sync_mutations", "label": "sync_mutations table (offline-write idempotency ledger)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The PowerSync upload-queue write path checks this ledger before applying, so at-least-once upload becomes exactly-once apply."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_audit_log", "label": "audit_log table (append-only, partitioned)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_ops_drills", "label": "ops_drills table (restore-drill evidence log)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Append-only because it is the evidence trail that backups actually restore \u2014 an untested backup is a rumour."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_jsonb_vs_relational_ruling", "label": "JSONB vs Relational \u2014 the ruling census", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "JSONB where a document is read and written whole (design payload, survey capture, proposal snapshot, price book, rules pack); relational where rows are summed, gated or queried (components, tranches, payments, blocks, entitlements)."}, {"id": "docs_04_data_model_append_only_census", "label": "Append-only census (no UPDATE/DELETE grants)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/04-data-model.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_04_data_model_tenants", "target": "docs_04_data_model_users", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "s